#: content/announcements/4/4.11.0/plasma.md:50
#: content/announcements/4/4.11.0/platform.md:36
msgid ""
"In order to get the most out of these releases, we recommend to use a recent "
"version of Qt, such as 4.8.4. This is necessary in order to assure a stable "
"and performant experience, as some improvements made to KDE software have "
"actually been done in the underlying Qt framework.<br /> In order to make "
"full use of the capabilities of KDE's software, we also recommend to use the "
"latest graphics drivers for your system, as this can improve the user "
"experience substantially, both in optional functionality, and in overall "
"performance and stability."
msgstr ""

