msgid "KDE Ships KDE Applications 16.12.0"
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:5
msgid ""
"December 15, 2016. Today, KDE introduces KDE Applications 16.12, with an "
"impressive array of upgrades when it comes to better ease of access, the "
"introduction of highly useful functionalities and getting rid of some minor "
"issues, bringing KDE Applications one step closer to offering you the "
"perfect setup for your device."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:7
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Okular</a>, <a href='%[2]s'>Konqueror</a>, <a "
"href='%[3]s'>KGpg</a>, <a href='%[4]s'>KTouch</a>, <a href='%[5]s'>Kalzium</"
"a> and more (<a href='%[6]s'>Release Notes</a>) have now been ported to KDE "
"Frameworks 5. We look forward to your feedback and insight into the newest "
"features introduced with this release."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:9
msgid ""
"In the continued effort to make applications easier to build standalone, we "
"have split the kde-baseapps, kdepim and kdewebdev tarballs. You can find the "
"newly created tarballs at <a href='%[1]s'>the Release Notes document</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:11
msgid ""
"We have discontinued the following packages: kdgantt2, gpgmepp and kuser. "
"This will help us focus on the rest of the code."
msgstr ""

