msgid "Kwave sound editor joins KDE Applications!"
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:17
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Kwave</a> is a sound editor, it can record, play back, "
"import and edit many sorts of audio files including multi channel files. "
"Kwave includes some plugins to transform audio files in several ways and "
"presents a graphical view with a complete zoom and scroll capability."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:19
msgid "The World as your wallpaper"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:23
msgid ""
"Marble now includes both a Wallpaper and a Widget for Plasma that show the "
"time on top of a satellite view of the earth, with real-time day/night "
"display. These used to be available for Plasma 4; they have now been updated "
"to work on Plasma 5."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:25
msgid ""
"You can find more information on <a href='%[1]s'>Friedrich W. H. Kossebau's "
