#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:59
msgid ""
"Kdenlive has a new Rotoscoping effect, support for downloadable content and "
"an updated Motion Tracker. It also provides <a href='%[1]s'>Snap and "
"AppImage</a> files for easier installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/16.12.0.md:61
msgid ""
"KMail and Akregator can use Google Safe Browsing to check if a link being "
