#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:7
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:7
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:7
#: content/announcements/applications/18.12.0.md:11
msgid ""
"We continuously work on improving the software included in our KDE "
"Application series, and we hope you will find all the new enhancements and "
"bug fixes useful!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:9
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Software Compilation 4.11 Beta1"
msgid "What's new in KDE Applications 17.12"
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:11
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:11
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:11
msgid "System"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:15
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Dolphin</a>, our file manager, can now save searches and "
"limit the search only to folders. Renaming files is now easier; simply "
"double click on the file name. More file information is now at your hands, "
"as the modification date and origin URL of downloaded files are now "
"displayed in the information panel. Additionally, new Genre, Bitrate, and "
"Release Year columns have been introduced."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:17
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:64
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:32
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:19
msgid ""
"Our powerful document viewer <a href='%[1]s'>Okular</a> gained support for "
"HiDPI displays and Markdown language, and the rendering of documents that "
"are slow to load is now shown progressively. An option is now available to "
"share a document via email."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:21
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Gwenview</a> image viewer can now open and highlight images "
"in the file manager, zooming is smoother, keyboard navigation has been "
"improved, and it now supports the FITS and Truevision TGA formats. Images "
"are now protected from being accidentally removed by the Delete key when "
"they are not selected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:23
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:53
msgid "Multimedia"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:25
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Kdenlive</a> now uses less memory when handling video "
"projects which include many images, default proxy profiles have been "
"refined, and an annoying bug related to jumping one second forward when "
"playing backward has been fixed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:27
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:106
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:86
#: content/announcements/applications/18.12.0.md:98
#: content/announcements/applications/19.04.0.md:160
msgid "Utilities"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:31
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Ark</a>'s zip support in the libzip backend has been "
"improved. <a href='%[2]s'>Kate</a> has a new <a href='%[3]s'>Preview plugin</"
"a> that allows you to see a live preview of the text document in the final "
"format, applying any available KParts plugins (e.g. for Markdown, SVG, Dot "
"graph, Qt UI, or patches). This plugin also works in <a "
"href='%[4]s'>KDevelop.</a>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:33
#: content/announcements/applications/18.12.0.md:57
#: content/announcements/applications/19.04.0.md:118
msgid "Development"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:37
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Kompare</a> now provides a context menu in the diff area, "
"allowing for quicker access to navigation or modification actions. If you "
"are a developer, you might find KUIViewers' new in-pane preview of UI object "
"described by Qt UI files (widgets, dialogs, etc) useful. It now also "
"supports KParts streaming API."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:39
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:92
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:72
#: content/announcements/applications/18.12.0.md:38
#: content/announcements/applications/19.04.0.md:75
msgid "Office"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:41
msgid ""
"The <a href='%[1]s'>Kontact</a> team has been hard at work improving and "
"refining. Much of the work has been modernizing the code, but users will "
"notice that encrypted messages display has been improved and support has "
"been added for text/pgp and <a href='%[2]s'>Apple® Wallet Pass</a>. There is "
"now an option to select IMAP folder during vacation configuration, a new "
"warning in KMail when a mail gets reopened and identity/mailtransport is not "
"the same, new <a href='%[3]s'>support for Microsoft® Exchange™</a>, support "
"for Nylas Mail and improved Geary import in the akonadi-import-wizard, along "
"with various other bug-fixes and general improvements."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:43
msgid "Games"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:47
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>KTuberling</a> can now reach a wider audience, as it has "
"been <a href='%[2]s'>ported to Android</a>. <a href='%[3]s'>Kolf</a>, <a "
"href='%[4]s'>KsirK</a>, and <a href='%[5]s'>Palapeli</a> complete the "
"porting of KDE games to Frameworks 5."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:51
msgid ""
"Even more applications which were based on kdelibs4 have now been ported to "
"KDE Frameworks 5. These include the music player <a href='%[1]s'>JuK</a>, "
"the download manager <a href='%[2]s'>KGet</a>, <a href='%[3]s'>KMix</a>, "
"utilities such as <a href='%[4]s'>Sweeper</a> and <a href='%[5]s'>KMouth</"
"a>, and <a href='%[6]s'>KImageMapEditor</a> and Zeroconf-ioslave. Many "
"thanks to the hard-working developers who volunteered their time and work to "
"make this happen!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:53
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.0.md:139
msgid "Applications moving to their own release schedule"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:55
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>KStars</a> now has its own release schedule; check this <a "
"href='%[2]s'>developer's blog</a> for announcements. It is worth noting that "
"several applications such as Kopete and Blogilo are <a href='%[3]s'>no "
"longer shipped</a> with the Application series, as they have not yet been "
"ported to KDE Frameworks 5, or are not actively maintained at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:59
msgid ""
"More than 110 bugs have been resolved in applications including the Kontact "
"Suite, Ark, Dolphin, Gwenview, K3b, Kate, Kdenlive, Konsole, Okular, "
"Umbrello and more!"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.0.md:63
msgid ""
"If you would like to read more about the changes in this release, <a "
"href='%[1]s'>head over to the complete changelog</a>. Although a bit "
"intimidating due to its breadth, the changelog can be an excellent way to "
"learn about KDE's internal workings and discover apps and features you never "
"knew you had."
msgstr ""

#: content/announcements/applications/17.12.1.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Software Compilation 4.11 Beta1"
msgid "KDE Ships KDE Applications 17.12.1"
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

