#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.1.md:7
msgid ""
"About 20 recorded bugfixes include improvements to Kontact, Cantor, Dolphin, "
"Gwenview, JuK, Okular, Umbrello, among others."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.04.1.md:11
