#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:9
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Software Compilation 4.11 Beta1"
msgid "What's new in KDE Applications 18.08"
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:15
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Dolphin</a>, KDE's powerful file manager, has received "
"various quality-of-life improvements:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:17
msgid ""
"The 'Settings' dialog has been modernized to better follow our design "
"guidelines and be more intuitive."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:18
msgid ""
"Various memory leaks that could slow down your computer have been eliminated."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:19
msgid "'Create New' menu items are no longer available when viewing the trash."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:20
msgid "The application now adapts better to high resolution screens."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:21
msgid ""
"The context menu now includes more useful options, allowing you to sort and "
"change the view mode directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:22
msgid ""
"Sorting by modification time is now 12 times faster. Also, you can now "
"launch Dolphin again when logged in using the root user account. Support for "
"modifying root-owned files when running Dolphin as a normal user is still "
"work in progress."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:26
msgid ""
"Multiple enhancements for <a href='%[1]s'>Konsole</a>, KDE's terminal "
"emulator application, are available:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:28
msgid ""
"The 'Find' widget will now appear on the top of the window without "
"disrupting your workflow."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:29
msgid ""
"Support for more escape sequences (DECSCUSR & XTerm Alternate Scroll Mode) "
"has been added."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:30
msgid "You can now also assign any character(s) as a key for a shortcut."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:36
msgid ""
"18.08 is a major release for <a href='%[1]s'>Gwenview</a>, KDE's image "
"viewer and organizer. Over the last months contributors worked on a plethora "
"of improvements. Highlights include:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:38
msgid ""
"Gwenview's statusbar now features an image counter and displays the total "
"number of images."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:39
msgid ""
"It is now possible to sort by rating and in descending order. Sorting by "
"date now separates directories and archives and was fixed in some situations."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:40
msgid ""
"Support for drag-and-drop has been improved to allow dragging files and "
"folders to the View mode to display them, as well as dragging viewed items "
"to external applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:41
msgid ""
"Pasting copied images from Gwenview now also works for applications which "
"only accept raw image data, but no file path. Copying modified images is now "
"supported as well."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:42
msgid ""
"Image resize dialog has been overhauled for greater usability and to add an "
"option for resizing images based on percentage."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:43
msgid "Red Eye Reduction tool's size slider and crosshair cursor were fixed."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:44
msgid ""
"Transparent background selection now has an option for 'None' and can be "
"configured for SVGs as well."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:48
msgid "Image zooming has become more convenient:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:50
msgid ""
"Enabled zooming by scrolling or clicking as well as panning also when the "
"Crop or Red Eye Reduction tools are active."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:51
msgid "Middle-clicking once again toggles between Fit zoom and 100% zoom."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:52
msgid ""
"Added Shift-middle-clicking and Shift+F keyboard shortcuts for toggling Fill "
"zoom."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:53
msgid "Ctrl-clicking now zooms faster and more reliably."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:54
msgid ""
"Gwenview now zooms to the cursor's current position for Zoom In/Out, Fill "
"and 100% zoom operations when using the mouse and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:56
msgid "Image comparison mode received several enhancements:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:58
msgid "Fixed size and alignment of the selection highlight."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:59
msgid "Fixed SVGs overlapping the selection highlight."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:60
msgid "For small SVG images, the selection highlight matches the image size."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:64
msgid ""
"A number of smaller enhancements was introduced to make your workflow even "
"more enjoyable:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:66
msgid ""
"Improved the fade transitions between images of varying sizes and "
"transparencies."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:67
msgid ""
"Fixed the visibility of icons in some floating buttons when a light color "
"scheme is used."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:68
msgid ""
"When saving an image under a new name, the viewer does not jump to an "
"unrelated image afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:69
msgid ""
"When the share button is clicked and kipi-plugins are not installed, "
"Gwenview will prompt the user to install them. After the installation they "
"are immediately displayed."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:70
msgid ""
"Sidebar now prevents getting hidden accidentally while resizing and "
"remembers its width."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:76
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>KMail</a>, KDE's powerful email client, features some "
"improvements in the travel data extraction engine. It now supports UIC 918.3 "
"and SNCF train ticket barcodes and Wikidata-powered train station location "
"lookup. Support for multi-traveler itineraries was added, and KMail now has "
"integration with the KDE Itinerary app."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:78
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Akonadi</a>, the personal information management framework, "
"is now faster thanks to notification payloads and features XOAUTH support "
"for SMTP, allowing for native authentication with Gmail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:80
msgid "Education"
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:84
msgid ""
"User experience in <a href='%[1]s'>KAlgebra</a>, our graphing calculator, "
"has been significantly improved for touch devices."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:90
msgid ""
"Contributors to <a href='%[1]s'>Spectacle</a>, KDE's versatile screenshot "
"tool, focused on improving the Rectangular Region mode:"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:92
msgid ""
"In Rectangular Region mode, there is now a magnifier to help you draw a "
"pixel-perfect selection rectangle."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:93
msgid "You can now move and resize the selection rectangle using the keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:94
msgid ""
"The user interface follows the user's color scheme, and the presentation of "
"the help text has been improved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:96
msgid ""
"To make sharing your screenshots with others easier, links for shared images "
"are now automatically copied to the clipboard. Screenshots can now be "
"automatically saved in user-specified sub-directories."
msgstr ""

#. type: html text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:98
msgid ""
"<a href='%[1]s'>Kamoso</a>, our webcam recorder, was updated to avoid "
"crashes with newer GStreamer versions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/applications/18.08.0.md:102
msgid ""
"More than 120 bugs have been resolved in applications including the Kontact "
"Suite, Ark, Cantor, Dolphin, Gwenview, Kate, Konsole, Okular, Spectacle, "
"Umbrello and more!"
msgstr ""

