#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.0.md:107
msgid "Media Controls on Lock Screen"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.11.95.md:121
msgid ""
"Media controls have been added to the lock screen, which can be disabled "
"since Plasma 5.12 for added privacy. Moreover, music will automatically "
"pause when the system suspends."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.11.95.md:123
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.0.md:111
msgid "New System Settings Interface"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
