#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:19
msgid "Plasma Browser Integration for Downloads and Media Controls"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:21
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:21
msgid "System Settings Redesigns"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:23
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:23
msgid ""
"Our settings pages are being redesigned. The KDE Visual Design Group has "
"reviewed many of the tools in System Settings and we are now implementing "
"those redesigns. KDE's Kirigami framework gives the pages a slick new look. "
"We started off with the theming tools, comprising the icons, desktop themes, "
"and cursor themes pages. The splash screen page can now download new "
"splashscreens from the KDE Store. The fonts page can now display previews "
"for the sub-pixel anti-aliasing settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:25
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:25
msgid "Desktop Theme"
