#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:31
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:31
msgid "New Look for Lock and Login Screens"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:33
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:33
msgid ""
"Our login and lock screens have a fresh new design, displaying the wallpaper "
"of the current Plasma release by default. The lock screen now incorporates a "
"slick fade-to-blur transition to show the controls, allowing it to be easily "
"used like a screensaver."
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.90.md:35
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.0.md:35
msgid "Lock Screen"
