msgid "Redesigned Virtual Desktop Settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:43
msgid ""
"System Settings Virtual Desktops page has been redesigned and rewritten for "
"support on Wayland, and now sports greater usability and visual consistency."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:45
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:49
msgid ""
"The user interface and layout for the <a data-toggle='lightbox' href='/"
"announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0/systemsettings-digital-clock.png'>Digital "
"Clock</a> and <a data-toggle='lightbox' href='/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0/"
"systemsettings-folderview-settings.png'>Folder View</a> settings pages have "
"been improved to better match the common style."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:47
msgid ""
"Many <a data-toggle='lightbox' href='/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0/"
"systemsettings-font.png'>System Settings pages</a> have been tweaked with "
"the goal of standardizing the icons, wording, and placement of the bottom "
"buttons, most notably the “Get New [thing]…” buttons."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:49
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:53
msgid ""
"New desktop effects freshly installed from store.kde.org now appear in the "
"list on the System Settings Desktop Effects page."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:51
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:55
msgid ""
"The native display resolution is now indicated with a star icon in the "
"System Settings Displays page."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:53
msgid ""
"The <a data-toggle='lightbox' href='/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0/"
"systemsettings-login.png'>System Settings Login Screen</a> page received "
"plenty of visual improvements. The image preview of the default Breeze theme "
"now reflects its current appearance, the background color of the preview "
"matches the active color scheme, and the sizes and margins were adjusted to "
"ensure that everything fits without being cut off."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:55
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:59
msgid ""
"The System Settings Desktop Effects page has been ported to QtQuickControls "
"2. This fixes a number of issues such as bad fractional scaling appearance, "
"ugly dropdown menu checkboxes, and the window size being too small when "
"opened as a standalone app."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:57
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:61
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Plasma 5"
msgid "Cross-Platform Integration"
msgstr "Plasma 5"

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:59
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:63
msgid "Firefox with native KDE open/save dialogs"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:61
msgid ""
"Firefox 64 can now optionally use native KDE open/save dialogs. This is an "
"optional, bleeding-edge functionality that is not yet included in any "
"distribution. However, it can be enabled by installing the <tt>xdg-desktop-"
"portal</tt> and <tt>xdg-desktop-portal-kde</tt> packages and setting "
"<tt>GTK_USE_PORTAL=1</tt> in Firefox's .desktop file."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:63
msgid ""
"Integration modules <tt>xdg-desktop-portal-kde</tt> and <tt>plasma-"
"integration</tt> now support the Settings portal. This allows sandboxed "
"Flatpak and Snap applications to respect your Plasma configuration - "
"including fonts, icons, widget themes, and color schemes - without requiring "
"read permissions to the kdeglobals configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:65
msgid ""
"The global scale factor used by high-DPI screens is now respected by GTK and "
"GNOME apps when it’s an integer."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:67
msgid ""
"A wide variety of issues with the Breeze-GTK theme have been resolved, "
"including the inconsistencies between the light and dark variants. We have "
"also made the theme more maintainable, so future improvements will be much "
"easier."
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:71
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:75
msgid "Distro Release Upgrade Notification"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:73
msgid ""
"Options for upgrading your distribution are now included in Discover’s "
"Update Notifier widget. The widget will also display a “Restart” button if a "
"restart is recommended after applying all updates, but the user hasn’t "
"actually restarted yet."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:75
msgid ""
"On Discover’s Updates page, it’s now possible to uncheck and re-check all "
"available updates to make it easier to pick and choose the ones you want to "
"apply."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:77
msgid ""
"<a data-toggle='lightbox' href='/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0/discover-"
"settings.png' data-toggle='lightbox'>Discover’s Settings page</a> has been "
"renamed to “Sources” and now has pushbuttons instead of hamburger menus."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:79
msgid ""
"Distribution repository management in Discover is now more practical and "
"usable, especially when it comes to Ubuntu-based distros."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:81
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:85
msgid ""
"Discover now supports app extensions offered with Flatpak packages, and lets "
"you choose which ones to install."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:83
msgid ""
"Handling for local packages has been improved, so Discover can now indicate "
"the dependencies and will show a 'Launch' button after installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:85
msgid ""
"When performing a search from the Featured page, Discover now only returns "
"apps in the search results. Add-ons will appear in search results only when "
"a search is initiated from an add-on category."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:87
msgid ""
"Discover’s search on the Installed Apps page now works properly when the "
"Snap backend is installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:89
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:93
msgid ""
"Handling and presentation of errors arising from misconfigured add-on repos "
"has also been improved."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:91
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:95
msgid ""
"Discover now respects your locale preferences when displaying dates and "
"times."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:93
msgid ""
"The “What’s New” section is no longer displayed on app pages when it doesn't "
"contain any relevant information."
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:95
msgid ""
"App and Plasma add-ons are now listed in a separate category on Discover’s "
"Updates page."
msgstr ""

