#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:121
msgid "WireGuard VPN Tunnels"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.90.md:119
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.15.0.md:123
msgid ""
"Plasma now offers support for WireGuard VPN tunnels when the appropriate "
