#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:21
msgid ""
"An Icon-Only Task Manager is used by default, and the default panel is now "
"slightly thicker"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:22
msgid ""
"On-screen displays (OSDs) that appear when changing the volume or display "
"brightness (for example) have been redesigned to be less obtrusive. And when "
"using the 'raise maximum volume' setting, the volume OSD will subtly warn "
"you when going over 100% volume"
