#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:23
msgid "Changing the display brightness now gives you a smooth transition"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:24
msgid ""
"The System Tray popup now shows items in a grid rather than a list, and the "
"icon view on your panel can now be configured to scale the icons with the "
"panel thickness if you'd like"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:25
msgid "The Digital Clock applet now shows the current date by default"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:26
msgid "The Digital Clock popup is now more compact and space-efficient"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:27
msgid ""
"Throughout KDE apps, toolbar buttons which display menus when clicked now "
"show downward-pointing arrows to indicate this"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:29
msgid "Workspace Behavior"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:31
msgid "GTK Window Controls"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:33
msgid "KRunner standalone"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:35
msgid ""
"Changed the default shortcut for moving and resizing windows to Meta+drag "
"(instead of Alt+drag) to resolve conflicts with many popular productivity "
"applications"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:36
msgid ""
"Clicking on grouped Task Manager tasks now cycles through each task by "
"default, and you can choose alternative behaviors if you don't like that one"
