#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:37
msgid ""
"The Task Manager can now be optionally configured to not minimize the active "
"task when clicked on"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:38
msgid ""
"On supported laptops, you can now configure a charge limit below 100% to "
"preserve the battery health"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:39
msgid ""
"You can now corner-tile windows by combining left/right/up/down tiling "
"shortcuts. For example, hit Meta+up arrow and then left arrow to tile a "
"window to the upper left corner."
