#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:42
msgid ""
"You are now notified when your system is about to run out of space even if "
"your home directory is on a different partition"
msgstr ""

#. type: List item
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.19.90.md:43
msgid ""
"Minimized windows are no longer placed last in the alt-tab task switcher"
