#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:5
msgid ""
"Tuesday, 27 January 2015. Today KDE releases Plasma 5.2. This release adds a "
"number of new components, many new features and many more bugfixes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:15
msgid ""
"This release of Plasma comes with some new components to make your desktop "
"even more complete:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:17
msgid ""
"<strong>BlueDevil</strong>: a range of desktop components to manage "
"Bluetooth devices. It'll set up your mouse, keyboard, send &amp; receive "
"files and you can browse for devices."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:19
msgid ""
"<strong>KSSHAskPass</strong>: if you access computers with ssh keys but "
"those keys have passwords this module will give you a graphical UI to enter "
"those passwords."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:21
msgid ""
"<strong>Muon</strong>: install and manage software and other addons for your "
"computer."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:23
msgid ""
"<strong>Login theme configuration (SDDM)</strong>: SDDM is now the login "
"manager of choice for Plasma and this new System Settings module allows you "
"to configure the theme."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:25
msgid ""
"<strong>KScreen</strong>: getting its first release for Plasma 5 is the "
"System Settings module to set up multiple monitor support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:27
msgid ""
"<strong>GTK Application Style</strong>: this new module lets you configure "
"themeing of applications from Gnome."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:32
msgid ""
"<strong>KDecoration</strong>: this new library makes it easier and more "
"reliable to make themes for KWin, Plasma's window manager. It has impressive "
"memory, performance and stability improvements. If you are missing a feature "
"don't worry it'll be back in Plasma 5.3."
msgstr ""

