#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:65
msgid ""
"Our desktop search feature Baloo sees optimisations on startup. It now "
"consumes 2-3x less CPU on startup. The query parser supports \"type\" / "
"\"kind\" properties, so you can type \"kind:Audio\" in krunner to filter out "
"Audio results."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.2.0.md:71
msgid ""
"In the screen locker we improved the integration with logind to ensure the "
