#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:0
msgid ""
"Plasma 5.21 is a looker! A new wallpaper, a new theme, and especially a new "
"app launcher make Plasma not only easier on the eyes, but also easier to use "
"and much more accessible.\n"
"Read on to discover everything that make 5.21 the most stunning Plasma yet!"
msgstr ""

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:0
msgid "Support unattended updates"
msgstr ""

#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:0
