#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KDE Software Compilation 4.11 Beta1"
msgid "Today KDE releases a beta update to its desktop software, Plasma 5.6."
msgstr "KDE-Software-Tosamenstellen 4.11 Beta 1"

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:9
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:9
msgid ""
"This release of Plasma brings many improvements to the task manager, "
"KRunner, activities, and Wayland support as well as a much more refined look "
"and feel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:11
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:11
msgid "Slicker Plasma Theme"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:13
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:13
msgid "Breeze Color Scheme Support"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:15
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:15
msgid ""
"The default Plasma theme, Breeze, now follows the application color scheme "
"allowing for a more personalized experience. A new 'Breeze Light' together "
"with 'Breeze Dark' theme can be used to bring back the previous behavior. "
"Additionally, tooltip animations have become more subtle."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:17
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:17
msgid "Supercharged Task Manager"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:19
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:19
msgid "Copy Progress"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:21
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:21
msgid ""
"Multitasking has just become easier. The much improved task manager in "
"Plasma 5.6 now displays progress of tasks, such as downloading or copying "
"files."
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:23
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:25
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:23
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:25
msgid "Media Controls"
msgstr ""

#. type: shortcode parameter
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:25
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:25
msgid "Media Controls in Panel and Tooltips"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:27
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:27
msgid ""
"Moreover, hovering a music or video player shows beautiful album art and "
"media controls, so you never have to leave the application you're currently "
"working with. Our media controller applet that shows up during playback also "
"received some updates, notably support for multiple players running "
"simultaneously."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain Text
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.5.95.md:29
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.6.0.md:33
msgid ""
"Not only did we improve interacting with running applications, starting "
"applications gets in your way less, too. Using Jump Lists you can launch an "
"application and jump, hence the name, to a specific task right away. This "
"feature is also present in the application launchers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
