"Discover: Fix enabling/disabling sources. <a href=\"https://commits.kde.org/"
"discover/7bdaa6d2f478be5422d4ef002518f2eabb1961dc\">Commit.</a> Fixes bug <a "
"href=\"https://bugs.kde.org/377327\">#377327</a>"
